sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Staff
    participant W as Web Client
    participant R as REST Routers + Auth
    participant I as Import Pipeline
    participant M as Identity Resolver
    participant Q as Review Queue
    participant E as Reconciliation Engine
    participant D as Database

    S->>W: Drop registration<br/>+ attendance files
    W->>R: POST /imports
    R->>R: Check login
    R->>I: Parse with adapter
    alt Missing required columns
        I-->>W: 422 errors, nothing saved
    else File is valid
        I->>D: Save import batch + raw rows
        I->>M: Normalized records
        M->>D: Link exact matches (NetID, then email)
        M->>Q: Rank the rest<br/>(score + reasons)
        I-->>W: Summary: matched / to review / row errors
    end
    S->>W: Compare side<br/>by side
    W->>R: POST /review/{id}
    R->>Q: Same person or keep separate
    Q->>D: Save decision + decided_by
    S->>W: Finalize event
    W->>R: POST /finalize
    R->>E: Compute statuses
    E->>D: Save 4 statuses
    E-->>W: Event reconciliation report
